"#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 180.6 -383.81)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:4.85em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="67.15"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F1.pic1.15" class="ltx_text">Pull record</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 107.09 -419.68 L 320.15 -419.68"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 320.71 -419.68)"><path style="fill:none" d="M -3.54 4.32 C -2.9 1.73 -1.45 0.5 0 0 C -1.45 -0.5 -2.9 -1.73 -3.54 -4.32"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 171.74 -434.46)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:6.13em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="84.87"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F1.pic1.16" class="ltx_text">Return record</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g stroke-dasharray="3.0pt,3.0pt" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 321.26 -450.39 L 108.19 -450.39"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" transform="matrix(-1.0 0.0 0.0 -1.0 107.64 -450.39)"><path style="fill:none" d="M -3.54 4.32 C -2.9 1.73 -1.45 0.5 0 0 C -1.45 -0.5 -2.9 -1.73 -3.54 -4.32"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 173.26 -445.23)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:6.03em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="83.37"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F1.pic1.17" class="ltx_text">Fetch referrer</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g stroke-dasharray="3.0pt,3.0pt" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 107.09 -481.1 L 320.15 -481.1"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 320.71 -481.1)"><path style="fill:none" d="M -3.54 4.32 C -2.9 1.73 -1.45 0.5 0 0 C -1.45 -0.5 -2.9 -1.73 -3.54 -4.32"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 168.43 -495.88)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:6.61em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="91.48"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F1.pic1.18" class="ltx_text">Return referrer</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 4.89 -525.51)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:23.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="321.48"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F1.pic1.19" class="ltx_text">Solid: main flow, Dashed: optional (signatures/evals)</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 1: </span>Time sequence diagram: publication and retrieval of an agent record in ADS storage architecture.</figcaption>
</figure>
<section id="S4.SSx1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Artifact Layout.</h4>

<div id="S4.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A record is stored as an OCI manifest whose config
media type denotes <span id="S4.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">application/vnd.ads.record+json</span> (illustrative) and
whose layers may include the serialized record plus optional extension payloads.
Tags may group semantically related variants (e.g., capability-sliced views) but
the authoritative identity remains the digest.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SSx1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Referrers via OCI Index.</h4>

<div id="S4.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SSx1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">OCI referrer APIs (and emerging
registry-native referrer indices) allow attachment of signature bundles,
evaluation datasets, or composition graphs without rewriting the underlying
object.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SSx1.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Transport Reuse Benefits.</h4>

<div id="S4.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SSx1.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">By delegating distribution to mature OCI
stacks <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">9</a>, <a href="#bib.bib10" title="" class="ltx_ref">10</a>]</cite>, ADS inherits: (i) parallel layer fetching and caching, (ii) existing CDN
acceleration, (iii) role-based access controls, (iv) integration with
Sigstore-compatible signing flows.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.1 </span>Multi-Registry Federation</h3>

<div id="S4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Organizations may host distinct registries while participating in a unified
discovery plane. Federation does <em id="S4.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">not</em> require global mirroring; only
digests (and optionally minimal metadata) must be resolvable across boundaries.</p>
</div>
<section id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Federation Modes.</h4>

<div id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ul id="S4.I1" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.2em;">
<li id="S4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">On-Demand Cross-Pull:</span> Peers retrieve artifacts lazily from
foreign registries when a CID is discovered.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Selective Replication:</span> Policy-driven mirroring of hot
artifacts into local registries to reduce latency.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Strategic Anchoring:</span> High-value or compliance-critical
records replicated across multiple jurisdictions for availability and audit
resilience.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Isolation and Autonomy.</h4>

<div id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Access policies, retention lifecycles, and
internal replication topologies remain a local concern; only content digests
plus optional provenance metadata traverse administrative boundaries.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S4.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Diagram: Storage Layers</h3>

<figure id="S4.F2" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F2.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="233.36" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 444.86 233.36" width="444.86"><g transform="translate(0,233.36) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(0.55,0) translate(0,232.81)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#191970;--ltx-fill-color:#191970;--ltx-fg-color:#191970;" color="#191970" fill="#191970" stroke="#191970" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 L 314.96 0"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#191970;--ltx-fill-color:#191970;--ltx-fg-color:#191970;" color="#191970" fill="#191970" stroke="#191970" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 -47.24 L 314.96 -47.24"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#191970;--ltx-fill-color:#191970;--ltx-fg-color:#191970;" color="#191970" fill="#191970" stroke="#191970" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 -94.49 L 314.96 -94.49"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#191970;--ltx-fill-color:#191970;--ltx-fg-color:#191970;" color="#191970" fill="#191970" stroke="#191970" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 -141.73 L 314.96 -141.73"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#191970;--ltx-fill-color:#191970;--ltx-fg-color:#191970;" color="#191970" fill="#191970" stroke="#191970" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 -188.98 L 314.96 -188.98"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.19 -15.27)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:24.09em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="333.32"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F2.pic1.1" class="ltx_text">OASF Agent Record (JSON, schema, skills, metadata)</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.19 -62.51)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:22.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="305.42"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F2.pic1.2" class="ltx_text">OCI Artifact Manifest (media type, config, layers)</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.19 -109.76)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="428.9"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F2.pic1.3" class="ltx_text">OCI Referrer Artifacts (Signatures, Evaluations, Composition Graphs)</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.19 -157)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:11.97em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="165.59"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F2.pic1.4" class="ltx_text">OCI Registry / ORAS API</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.19 -204.25)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:26.18em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflo