verflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="333.51"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S4.F2.pic1.7" class="ltx_text">Solid arrows: main flow; Dashed arrow: referrer linking</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span>Storage architecture: OASF agent records are stored as OCI manifests in registries backed by object storage. Artifact linking (signatures, evaluations, composition graphs) uses OCI referrers, which reference the manifest by digest.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
